<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-xudaoqi" source-id="s-songshu-050-xudaoqi-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-xudaoqi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">東海人<persName id="c-songshu-050-xudaoqi:p001:m0003" ref="zd7_s50_u6k">徐道期</persName>流寓廣州，無士行，為僑舊所陵侮。因刺史<persName id="c-songshu-050-xudaoqi:p001:m0025" ref="k4m_bvv_xwm">謝欣</persName>死，合率羣不逞之徒作亂，攻沒州城，殺士庶素憾者百餘，傾府庫，招集亡命，出攻始興。</p>
</text>
